terraleph ▸ a-ready                                                    terraform
a┌Help────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
┌│ Current: Multi-environment Overview                                      ▲ │┐
││ ↑ / ↓ / j / k      select rows in [2] or scroll [3]                      ┃ ││
││ Space              toggle a group or the Same change summary in [2]      ┃ ││
││ [ / ]              select the previous or next environment               ┃ ││
││ 2 / 3              focus Compare / Relations                             ┃ ││
││ f                  maximize or restore [2] Compare / [3] Relations       ┃ ││
││ Enter              [2] opens the selected source; [3] the plan top       ┃ ││
└│ /                  filter [2] addresses; [3] still shows everything      │ │┘
┌│ r                  retry the selected Error environment                  │ │┐
││                                                                          │ ││
││ Other                                                                    │ ││
