││ PgUp / PgDn        move rows in [2] or scroll [3]                        │ ││
││ Home / End / g / G first/last row in [2]; scroll [3] to an edge          │ ││
││ v                  open the full plan from the top                       │ ││
││ y                  copy the selected environment's plan                  │ ││
││ c                  show environment context                              │ ││
